<title>BERMUDA: GCR Holdings gross written premiums flat.</title>
<headline>GCR Holdings gross written premiums flat.</headline>
<dateline>HAMILTON, Bermuda 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>GCR Holdings Ltd said gross written premiums were about flat for the second quarter compared with the second quarter a year earlier.</p>
<p>Gross written premiums were $66.0 million versus $66.5 million in the same period a year earlier, the company said.</p>
<p>GCR reported net income for the second quarter of fiscal 1997 was $17.2 million or $0.69 a share, compared with $26.4 million or $1.02 a share in the same period a year earlier.</p>
</text>
